+  <PageOrientation eyebrow="About" title="Current context." summary="I am an Informatics bachelor's student based in Prague, building technical systems and investigating data, uncertainty and computation." coordinate="BEARING / ABOUT / PRAGUE" />
+  <section class="boundary-grid"><div><ResponsiveMedia alt="David Anderle" /></div><div><p>I am completing a bachelor's in Informatics at the Czech University of Life Sciences Prague, expected June 2027, and I am based in Prague.</p><p>I tend to work by narrowing a question, building an inspectable artifact, testing what can be tested and stating what the result does not show.</p></div></section>
   <CurrentStage />
   <div class="prose"><h2>Education context</h2><p>I completed a non-degree exchange at the University of Wisconsin-Madison from September 2025 to May 2026. It is a dated educational context, not a degree or current affiliation.</p><h2>Earlier experience</h2><p>I completed two short school IT training placements at Hewlett Packard Enterprise in Prague, in May 2022 and May 2023. They are not presented as employment or internships.</p><h2>Outside the record</h2><p>I am interested in aviation, mountains, travel and systems where technical decisions meet real constraints. These are interests, not credentials.</p></div>
 </BaseLayout>
